      "blocks": {
        "220d07ae-628e-4a7c-ac94-7176cee09360": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "We like to think of every aspect of our business as sustainable.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "8586e47e-6008-4300-a4c4-72d4b70cb546": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We've been lucky enough to see our work through the lens of the impact it can have. And, we're excited to share with you some of the things we do to reduce, reuse and recycle—and the impact they can have. </p><h4>We think that doing small things with a lot of love can have a lot of impact on people and the world around us.</h4>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
